  "reasoning": "The defendant purchased and possessed ivory (elephant) and hornbill products, both of which are classified as national first‑ and second‑level protected wildlife. Under Chinese Criminal Law, the illegal acquisition, sale, transport, or use of such protected wildlife and their products constitutes the crime of illegal trade in protected wildlife. No other criminal conduct is described, so the sole applicable charge is the offense of illegal buying, selling, transporting, carrying, or using of national key protected wildlife and their products.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法买卖、运输、携带、利用国家重点保护野生动物及其制品<eoa>"
